(1 AND 0) OR 0 = 0
(1 AND 1) OR 0 = 1
(0 AND 0) OR 1 = 1
(0 AND 1) OR 1 = 1
(1 AND 0) OR 1 = 1
(1 AND 1) OR 1 = 1
